menu "Bridge settings"

    config BRIDGE_HAS_MIC
        bool "Bridge has a microphone"
        default n
        help
            On: the bridge measures its own INMP441 and reports it as node 0, and can
            stream its raw audio to the Pi ("audio on"). Off: it only relays the
            remote nodes. Its mic was moved to a node in Oct 2026, so this is off.

endmenu
